     "content_html": "Many nurses left the health care system.",
     "correctness": "1.0"
    },
    {
     "id": 1275073,
     "content_html": "Nursing salaries have decreased due to the impact of COVID-19 on the finances of health systems.",
     "correctness": "0.0"
